Provides: gliner-rs
Maintainer: apiplant <releases@apiplant.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/gliner-rs
Description: Rust (candle) inference for GLiNER2 checkpoints (CUDA build)
 gliner, gliner-classify, gliner-pii and gliner-guardrails run GLiNER2
 boundary-architecture checkpoints (entity extraction, zero-shot
 classification, PII detection/redaction and LLM guardrails) locally via
 candle, downloading checkpoints from Hugging Face on first use. This build
 is linked against CUDA and needs an NVIDIA GPU with a host driver
 compatible with the CUDA toolkit version it was built against (see
 https://github.com/apiplant/gliner-rs/blob/main/packaging/README.md).
 libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package) satisfies the runtime
 link; it does not by itself guarantee driver/toolkit compatibility.
